{
  "info": {
    "name": "RIVA Backend - Cybersecurity Sprint",
    "description": "Validacao manual dos 5 blocos de seguranca do riva-backend.\n\nPRE-REQUISITO: subir o servidor com:\n  ./mvnw.cmd spring-boot:test-run \"-Dspring-boot.run.profiles=test\"\n\nRode os requests na ordem (de cima para baixo). Os tokens sao salvos automaticamente.\nO banco e H2 em memoria: reiniciar o servidor zera os dados.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "testUser", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Bloco 1 - Validacao e Sanitizacao",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "XSS no username (espera 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Bloqueado com 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('Nao vaza stack trace', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('Exception'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"<script>alert(1)</script>\",\"email\":\"hacker1@example.com\",\"password\":\"Senha123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Tenta cadastrar com tag <script> no username. A whitelist @Pattern + @SafeText bloqueia."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "SQL injection no username (espera 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Bloqueado com 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin'; DROP TABLE users;--\",\"email\":\"hacker2@example.com\",\"password\":\"Senha123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Payload de SQL injection no username e rejeitado pela validacao."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Email invalido (espera 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Bloqueado com 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "pm.test('Tem mapa de erros por campo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('errors'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"userteste\",\"email\":\"isso-nao-e-email\",\"password\":\"Senha123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Email em formato invalido e rejeitado por @Email."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "JSON malformado (espera 400, nao 500)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Bloqueado com 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{isso nao e json valido}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Corpo malformado cai no GlobalExceptionHandler como 400, nunca 500."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bloco 2 - Autenticacao e RBAC",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Registrar usuario comum (USER)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('testUser', 'vitoka_' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Criado com 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', body.accessToken);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', body.refreshToken);",
                  "pm.test('Retornou access + refresh token', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.refreshToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"{{testUser}}\",\"email\":\"{{testUser}}@example.com\",\"password\":\"Senha123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um usuario com role USER. Salva o token automaticamente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login admin (ADMIN)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login OK 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', pm.response.json().accessToken);",
                  "pm.test('expiresIn = 1800s (30 min)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().expiresIn).to.eql(1800));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin\",\"password\":\"TestAdminPassword123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Loga com o admin criado automaticamente no start. Salva o adminToken."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Login com senha errada (espera 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Rejeitado com 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test('Mensagem generica', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Credenciais invalidas'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin\",\"password\":\"senhaERRADA999\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Senha incorreta retorna 401 com mensagem generica."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Endpoint protegido SEM token (espera 401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Bloqueado com 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/lista",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "lista"]
            },
            "description": "Sem token, qualquer rota protegida retorna 401 JSON."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. USER tentando area de ADMIN (espera 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('RBAC bloqueia com 403', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));",
                  "pm.test('Mensagem Acesso negado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().message).to.eql('Acesso negado'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/teste",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "teste"]
            },
            "description": "Token de USER nao acessa /admin/**. RBAC retorna 403."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. ADMIN acessando area de ADMIN (espera 404 = passou RBAC)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Passou no RBAC (nao e 403)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(403));",
                  "pm.test('404 = autorizado, mas endpoint nao existe', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/teste",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "teste"]
            },
            "description": "Token de ADMIN passa pelo RBAC. Da 404 porque o endpoint em si nao existe (sera criado pelos colegas)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7. Refresh token (espera 200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Renovou com 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Retornou novo access token', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().accessToken).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"refreshToken\":\"{{refreshToken}}\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Usa o refresh token salvo no request 1 para gerar um novo access token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bloco 3 - CORS",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CORS origem permitida (localhost:3000)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Preflight aceito', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Header Access-Control-Allow-Origin presente', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Access-Control-Allow-Origin')).to.eql('http://localhost:3000');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "OPTIONS",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Origin", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
              { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Method", "value": "POST" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Preflight CORS de uma origem permitida. Retorna o header Access-Control-Allow-Origin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "CORS origem proibida (espera 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Origem maliciosa rejeitada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "OPTIONS",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Origin", "value": "http://site-malicioso.com" },
              { "key": "Access-Control-Request-Method", "value": "POST" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Preflight de origem nao listada e rejeitado com 403."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bloco 4 - Protecao de Dados",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login - resposta NUNCA traz senha",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Resposta nao contem campo password', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.text().toLowerCase()).to.not.include('password');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin\",\"password\":\"TestAdminPassword123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "O campo password tem @JsonIgnore - nunca aparece em resposta. A criptografia AES do email no banco e provada pelo teste automatizado EncryptionAtRestIntegrationTest."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Bloco 5 - Logs e Auditoria",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (gera trilha de auditoria)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "console.log('>> Agora olhe o TERMINAL do servidor:');",
                  "console.log('>> deve aparecer a linha: Auditoria: action=LOGIN resource=/api/v1/auth/login');",
                  "console.log('>> e todas as linhas tem [trace=... ip=... user=...] (MDC)');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"username\":\"admin\",\"password\":\"TestAdminPassword123\"}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Apos enviar, olhe o console do servidor: aparece 'Auditoria: action=LOGIN' (trilha de auditoria) e cada log tem trace_id/client_ip/user_id (MDC). A entrada vai para a tabela audit_logs."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
